---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="关于">
  <div class="max-w-2xl w-full">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="text-7 font-bold mb-4">关于</h1>
      <p class="text-4">雪音（Yukine / ゆきね）</p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-4 mb-10">
      <p>音，聲也。生於心，有節於外，謂之音。——《说文》</p>

      <p>这里是 Tosd0 的个人博客，用来存放随笔和笔记等，也会涉及日常开发、工具实践等经验。</p>
    </section>

    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <section class="border border-primary/20 rounded p-4">
        <h2 class="text-5 font-bold mb-4">联系</h2>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <li>
            GitHub:
            <a class="link" href="https://github.com/tosd0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://github.com/tosd0</a
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            Email:
            <a class="link" href="mailto:hi@yukine.cc">hi@yukine.cc</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="border border-primary/20 rounded p-4">
        <h2 class="text-5 font-bold mb-4">致谢</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          博客实现思路来自
          <a class="link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://www.yoake.cc"> @YOAKE </a>
          的
          <a class="link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://www.yoake.cc/posts/20251222-71d5/"> 文章 </a>
          。
        </p>
        <p>
          模板来自
          <a class="link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://typography.moeyua.com"> @Moeyua </a>
          的
          <a class="link" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://github.com/Moeyua/astro-theme-typography">
            Typography
          </a>
          。
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
